    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d97">

                <pb facs="0211" n="105" xml:id="pg105"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Egan to Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-02-23"><hi rendition="#italic">February 23, 1891</hi>.</date>
                        (Received April 25.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 135.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that on
                    yesterday I received from Rear-Admiral McCann a telegram requesting that I would
                    notify the Department of the Navy of his arrival at Talcahuano. I accordingly
                    cabled as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#flush">To <hi rendition="#small-caps">Blaine</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington:</hi></p>
                        <p><hi rendition="#italic">Pensacola</hi> arrived Talcahuano 20th. Admiral
                            McCann desires inform Secretary Navy. Some fighting Iquique. Remainder
                            country tranquil. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Egan</hi>.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Patrick Egan</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
